/**
 * @addtogroup Foundation_BuildGuide_PresetNaming
 *
 * Foundation presets should identify the generated artifact.
 *
 * @section FoundationBuildPresetDesktop Desktop Naming
 *
 * Desktop presets use:
 *
 * @code
 * platform_toolchain_architecture_configuration
 * @endcode
 *
 * Example:
 *
 * @code
 * windows_msvc_x64_release
 * @endcode
 *
 * Meaning:
 *
 * @code
 * windows_msvc_x64_release
 * │       │    │   └── configuration
 * │       │    └────── architecture
 * │       └─────────── toolchain
 * └─────────────────── platform
 * @endcode
 *
 * @section FoundationBuildPresetEmbedded Embedded Naming
 *
 * Embedded presets use:
 *
 * @code
 * platform_toolchain_core_abi_configuration
 * @endcode
 *
 * Example:
 *
 * @code
 * psoc5lp_armgcc_cortex_m3_soft_release
 * @endcode
 *
 * Meaning:
 *
 * @code
 * psoc5lp_armgcc_cortex_m3_soft_release
 * │       │       │         │    └── configuration
 * │       │       │         └────── ABI / FPU mode
 * │       │       └──────────────── CPU core
 * │       └──────────────────────── toolchain
 * └──────────────────────────────── platform / family
 * @endcode
 *
 * @section FoundationBuildPresetSpecial Special Presets
 *
 * Documentation and coverage may use descriptive names:
 *
 * @code
 * documentation
 * windows_msvc_x64_coverage
 * @endcode
 */
